\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  When we live in unity
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 O how pleasant life can be!
\par When believers in the Lord
\par Share a common house and bond,
\par And with one accord agree.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Love sheds blessings all around,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 As the precious oil flowed down,
\par Poured on holy Aaron's head,
\par Running down upon his beard
\par To the collar of his gown.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When we share a friendship true,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Then it's like the morning dew
\par Which by rural paths we see,
\par Sparkling bright on grass and tree,
\par \pard       Making farm and forest new.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

